# DP Document Warsaw Slot Monitor

## Async Python
Use asyncio throughout. Public functions must be `async` with type hints. No blocking I/O on the event loop.

## Layer separation
- src/handlers/ — Telegram I/O only; no database access.
- src/services/ — business logic; no Telegram types.
- src/database/ — persistence only; no Telegram or domain policy.

## Exceptions and logging
Catch specific exceptions; never bare `except` or silent swallow. Structured logging with context (`extra=`); no `print` for ops logs.
